@levels 40-50
after all these levels i still get a little proud when i see the albion banner
[seen|watched] a lot of albs come and go, [the realm keeps going|the stubborn ones stay|the good ones always come back]
@levels *
@who Crafter
albion smiths know plate better than anyone, ask any alb crafter
[a well made|a good] [albion|alb] [breastplate|helm] is [worth every coin|a work of art], the hibs can keep their cloth
@who Explorer
i have walked every road in albion and i still find new corners
[every|each] old ruin in albion has a story, [i want to hear all of them|someone should write them down]
@who Socialite
the best thing about albion is the people, even the grumpy ones
[love|i love] how [friendly|chatty] albion is, [even the guards say hello|nobody walks past a stranger]
@who Daredevil
an alb is never more alive than when outnumbered
